The central rule of this pass is:

DEFAULT KNOCKBACK IS THE ATTACK’S OWN NATURAL LAUNCH STRENGTH.

ACCUMULATED KNOCKBACK IS THE FIGHTER’S DAMAGE-LIKE NUMBER THAT ADDS EXTRA LAUNCH VULNERABILITY.

THEY ARE TWO DIFFERENT VALUES.

FINAL LAUNCH COMBINES THEM; IT DOES NOT MULTIPLY ONE BY THE OTHER.
